message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Seyir"
abstract: >-
  Browser extension and MCP bridge that lets opencode AI agents drive the
  user's real Chromium browser (Brave or Chrome) with their logged-in
  sessions, inside a tab group of their own per conversation. The agent
  navigates, reads pages through the accessibility tree, clicks, types and
  fills forms; it sees no other tabs, no network port is opened, and the user
  can pause or cancel it at any time.
authors:
